{"id":"290526","name":"泡菜","author":"猫哥知味","authorId":"9684635","desc":"","cover":"images/290526/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"白萝卜","amount":"1颗"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"1个"},{"name":"苦瓜","amount":"半根"},{"name":"樱桃萝卜","amount":"4个"},{"name":"莲藕","amount":"100g"},{"name":"木耳","amount":"50g"}],"sub":[{"name":"泡椒","amount":"50g"},{"name":"生姜","amount":"50g"},{"name":"大蒜","amount":"50g"},{"name":"白醋","amount":"适量"},{"name":"花椒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"白糖","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"白萝卜用刮皮刀刮成薄片","img":"images/290526/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"用盐腌制30分钟","img":"images/290526/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"用手将萝卜的水挤压出来，使萝卜吃起来更脆","img":"images/290526/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"将食材切成适量的大小","img":"images/290526/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"焯水杀菌","img":"images/290526/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"木耳煮熟，晾凉","img":"images/290526/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"泡菜玻璃瓶用开水消毒不要有生水，会让泡菜变质","img":"images/290526/step_7.png"},{"step":8,"desc":"将食材依次放入玻璃瓶，加半瓶醋、一两白酒、一勺糖、适量盐还有适量矿泉水","img":"images/290526/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"玻璃瓶封口，放阴凉处存放48小时","img":"images/290526/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"开罐，吃起来","img":"images/290526/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：汤锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}